  "description": "A series of crimes based on fairytales. \n\nA murderer by the alias “The Tale” is on the loose, and he uses fairytales to manipulate others into kidnapping and killing his victims for him. Five missing women. Five mysterious invitations. One party. Will the unlikely duo of elite detective and playful author be able to work around their differences to get to the bottom of the case? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
